# WeatherX does not require any API keys.
# All weather and geocoding data is fetched from Open-Meteo's free,
# key-less public APIs (see README.md for details), and reverse
# geocoding uses BigDataCloud's free client-side endpoint.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder in case you extend WeatherX with
# a service that does require credentials. If you add one, define it
# here (without real values) and read it in code via:
#   import.meta.env.VITE_YOUR_VARIABLE_NAME
#
# Example:
# VITE_SOME_API_KEY=your_key_here
